   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) garantir que les parties prenantes, &#xe0; tous les stades de la cha&#xee;ne des transactions financi&#xe8;res, et ceux qui leur demandent des comptes, disposent de preuves et d&apos;analyses objectives et fiables sur les besoins et les ressources humanitaires; 2) garantir qu&apos;une base de donn&#xe9;es solide informe les d&#xe9;cisions de r&#xe9;ponse &#xe0; la crise sur le financement international de l&apos;aide humanitaire.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) ensured stakeholders, at all stages of the financing transaction chain and those who hold them to account, have objective and reliable evidence and analysis on humanitarian needs and resources; and (2) ensured a robust evidence-base informs Crisis-response decisions on international humanitarian financing.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
